Existing credit card systems rely on manual and time-consuming processes for application, document verification, and approval, leading to delays and inefficiency before card issuance. 
After issuance, the lack of effective real-time transaction monitoring and fraud detection increases security risks and unauthorized transactions. 
Therefore, there is a need for a secure and automated credit card processing system that integrates application handling, verification, approval, and continuous transaction monitoring to ensure faster processing, 
improved security, and better user experience.
